msgid "This emulator emulates an MSX2 and uses unofficial QUANTIKA ROMs. Quantika ROM are compatible with original ones to some extent, but some games may not work. Enabling MSX1 compatibility mode (Options menu) may help, especially with games from the early days of the MSX."
